          "content": "2. ENTRY POINTS",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "J1ErG",
          "name": "Body 2. ENTRY POINTS",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- / (LandingPage.tsx) public; logged-in user is sent to /dashboard (LandingPage.tsx:30)\n- /invite/:token (InviteRedeemPage.tsx), admin copies the link (AdminInvitationsPage.tsx:217)\n- /auth/callback?token= after GitHub (AuthCallbackPage.tsx:12)\n- /login only redirects to / (App.tsx:61)",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NL0JA",
          "name": "Heading 3. SCREENS (left → right)",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3. SCREENS (left → right)",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e1TYb",
          "name": "Body 3. SCREENS (left → right)",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each screen as Mobile (375) then Desktop (1440):\n- Landing — Paper Gate seal over the H1, temple art (full-bleed on mobile, right column on desktop), Sign in with GitHub, then Access (request form) directly under the hero, then What is here and How a kata works\n- Invite — interior art (top on mobile, left half on desktop), lockup with the seal\n- AuthCallback — Pending, Failed: large seal and dojo_ lockup centered, status line pinned to the bottom",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mMuMD",
          "name": "Heading 4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HabKk",
          "name": "Body 4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Hero 'Sign in with GitHub' and nav 'Sign in' both go to API_URL/auth/github; 'request one here' scrolls to #access (LandingPage.tsx)\n- Access moves above What is here: the two ways in come first\n- 'What is here' lists published scrolls from GET /scrolls when there are any; nothing when there are none or the request fails\n- Request access 503 (no Resend keys) says to ask the person who runs the instance, not to try again\n- ?error=session_expired | invite_required | invite_invalid get their own banner text, any other value gets the generic GitHub sign-in text\n- AuthCallback failed stays on the page (no auto redirect) with 'Try again' to /?error=auth\n- The kata preview (desktop only in code) is dropped: the hero carries the art instead",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TXrhW",
          "name": "Heading 5. COPY SOURCE",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5. COPY SOURCE",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "T4VULl",
          "name": "Body 5. COPY SOURCE",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "apps/web/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx, InviteRedeemPage.tsx, AuthCallbackPage.tsx — every string verbatim, no new copy. Art: design/brand/art/temple-1600.png and interior-1600.png (site/art carries the WebP). Sample data: token.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ecItG",
          "name": "Heading 6. STATES NOT DRAWN",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "6. STATES NOT DRAWN",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
