          "name": "Body 6. STATES NOT DRAWN",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Landing with published scrolls — a list of scroll titles under 'What is here'\n- Landing error banner (4 messages) — string swap on one strip above the nav\n- RequestAccessForm submitting / error / 503 / success — owned by the form, copy in code\n- Landing loading ('_' blink) — root gate\n- Sumi — every board is Washi; Sumi is the same tokens",
