          "name": "Body 3. SCREENS (left → right)",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each as Mobile (375) then Desktop (1440), all four on one pattern: nav, the Paper Gate in border colour at low opacity behind the copy, pill, title, body, actions, footer.\n- Error / 5xx\n- NotFound / 404\n- Profile / 404\n- Share / Not found",
