          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dxPPx",
          "name": "Body 4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Every error screen uses PublicPageLayout with hideCta (the body carries the one filled CTA); on mobile the nav is only the wordmark\n- Mobile stacks the actions full width (flex-col sm:flex-row)\n- Profile and Share 404 render a bare ErrorState in code today; they move into the same layout (D70)\n- Profile 404 has one action 'Go home'; Share 404 uses kind not-found and one action 'Enter the dojo'",
