                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "yZyh1",
                  "name": "Description",
                  "content": "The logo is now the Paper Gate, cut from four pieces of paper, on the app icon, the favicon and the share cards. Dojo comes in Washi and Sumi only: the Slate Indigo theme is gone, and if you had picked it, Dojo follows your system setting again.",
                  "width": "fill_container"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "o2eeWP",
              "name": "Entry 2026-10-02",
              "width": "fill_container",
